# spring-webmvc 6.2.x: RCE via path handling in XsltView.
# Fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4). This app does not use XsltView
# or any server-side view rendering (JSON REST API only).
# Action: upgrade to Spring Boot 4 before expiry.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2026-12-31

# spring-webmvc 6.2.x: stream corruption in Server-Sent Events with view rendering.
# Fixed only in Spring Framework 7. This app does not use SSE or views.
